{ 0x7094, { "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""You speak of peace, and\x01""parting.", "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Peace. Yes. When I have it,\x01""princess, no one will part from\x01""me." } },
{ 0x7095, { "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""You send me home to regain lost\x01""time.", "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Home. The desert. I shall go\x01""home only to bring the world\x01""back with me." } },
